ion/component tests. Slight APP mass increase (41 → 43) accepted per \"Rule 2 trumps APP.\"\n\n## Step 7: Report\n\n**Refactoring**: Extracted named constants `SWORD_BASE_PREMIUM`, `FIRST_INSURANCE_SURCHARGE_RATE`; renamed `firstInsurance` → `firstInsuranceSurcharge`\n**Mass Change**: 41 → 43 (accepted, clarity over mass per Rule 2)\n**Tests**: All passing (2 passed, 36 todo)"}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-24_16-00-47_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_opus-4-8-no-thinking/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 2\nRecent Green phase: quote() now sums sword base premium (100), adds 10% first-insurance surcharge and processing fee, rounds up with Math.ceil.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 2\nRecent Green phase: quote() now sums sword base premium (100), adds 10% first-insurance surcharge and processing fee, rounds up with Math.ceil.\n\nRefactor the implementation while keeping all tests green.\n\nRun autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784908958994},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll start by reading the current implementation and test files."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_013ouL2QTD3fdGrq7tJAZV67","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_vrtx_0152x88can5Xa8zyoVNEmvKd","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.spec.ts"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"vertex/claude-opus-4-8@eu","usage":{"input":203,"output":123,"cacheRead":9704,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":1003